Welcome to Cardmaniacs! This guide will help you get started with the app.

## Download

Cardmaniacs is available on the App Store for macOS, iOS, and iPadOS. Download it from the App Store and sign in with your Apple ID to enable iCloud Sync.

## Add your first feed

1. Click the **+** button in the toolbar
2. Paste a website URL or RSS feed URL
3. Cardmaniacs will auto-detect the feed and subscribe you

## Save an article for later

Save articles with the **Safari web extension** (or drag and drop URLs directly into Cardmaniacs). System-wide share capture is on the roadmap.

## Organize with tags

Select any article or bookmark and add tags to organize your content. Create smart folders that automatically collect content based on tag rules.
